{%- comment -%}
  Site-wide typeface: Jost — a geometric sans in the Futura family
  (single-story "a", circular letterforms), matching the Pierre Augustin
  Rose look. Overrides every font on the page; real Futura and Century
  Gothic serve as fallbacks while the webfont loads, and code/monospace
  spots keep a mono face.

  Install: render this once in the <head> of layout/theme.liquid:
    {% render 'dynamic-font' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{% # theme-check-disable RemoteAsset %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% # theme-check-enable RemoteAsset %}
<style>
  body, body * { font-family: "Jost", "Futura", "Century Gothic", "Avenir Next", sans-serif !important; }
  pre, code, kbd, samp, pre *, code * { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace !important; }
</style>
